subtitle: "An industrial world that remembers."
description: "A derelict machine-planet slowly wakes as its ancient industry runs again. Alpha build: the VESPER planet and Chapter One of its campaign, The Silent Basin (Play > Campaign, then VESPER): First Awakening, Resonance Fault and The Buried Foundry, linked by its own tech tree and the records you recover. The three maps can also be played on their own (Play > Custom Game)."
